{"content": "# 日子\n\n<div class=\"tab-buttons\">\n<button class=\"tab-btn active\" onclick=\"window.switchTabPanel('p-1', this, 'Group')\">起床</button>\n<button class=\"tab-btn\" onclick=\"window.switchTabPanel('p-2', this, 'Group')\">Morning</button>\n<button class=\"tab-btn\" onclick=\"window.switchTabPanel('p-3', this, 'Group')\">起きた</button>\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"p-1\" class=\"tab-panel\" data-group=\"Group\" style=\"display: block;\">\n\n「在明日跟來年之間，選擇了明天。」\n\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"p-2\" class=\"tab-panel\" data-group=\"Group\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div id=\"lang-en\">\n\n“Between the morrow and next year, tomorrow is chosen.”\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"p-3\" class=\"tab-panel\" data-group=\"Group\" style=\"display: none;\">\n\n:::lang[ja]\n「^^明日(あす)^^でも、来年でも。^^明日(あした)^^がいい。」\n:::\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"md-tab-end\"></div>", "hashes": {"md_source": "7e412cb4", "art_detail": "0f7485b6"}}